    "Scouting Notes": "POST DRAFT NOTES\n Fastball’s been up to 97 mph with heavy, firm arm side tailing action.\n Up to 20\" of IVB on the pitch, so it plays well up too\n Nasty upper 80s slider nearing 2800 rpm with short, sharp two plane tilt, potentially a plus pitch\n Hammer curveball in the low 80s features an 11 5 break with strong spin and sharpness as it finishes through the zone, could be a double plus pitch\n Also a less used changeup that he kills velo on decently but needs work\n Flores shows the ability to land all three pitches for strikes at times, but command was an issue for him in HS\n I think he can start with the work the Brewers will do with him",
